ItemDisplay[SHIELD ROLL_BLOCK_TAG !STAT360=73 $f(STAT20-BASEBLOCK>0)]:%WHITE%$f(STAT20-BASEBLOCK)%LIGHT_GRAY%blk%CS%%NAME%{%NAME%}%CONTINUE%
