ItemDisplay[(amu OR ram) STAT20=10 STAT360=67]:%WHITE%10%LIGHT_GRAY%blk%CS%%NAME%{%NAME%}%CONTINUE%
ItemDisplay[(amu OR ram) STAT20=20 STAT360=67]:%WHITE%20%LIGHT_GRAY%blk%CS%%NAME%{%NAME%}%CONTINUE%

// ---- Faster Block Rate (stat 102, priority 136) ----

// Faster Block Rate on Gloves and Boots
